    <string name="privacy_detail">Despensa al Día was built with privacy in mind.\n\n• Your core data (inventory, settings, lists) is stored locally on your device using Room.\n• We do not require accounts, emails or passwords.\n• Optional online features may contact external public services for barcode lookup, recipes, currency rates or Gemini responses.\n• If you use Gemini, your question and pantry context can be sent to Google using your API key.\n• If you uninstall the app, your data will be lost unless you use the JSON backup feature.\n\nYour pantry, your rules, your privacy.</string>
